# Copy to `.env.development` (gitignored) for local `npm run dev`.

# Uncomment and set to your deployed **RiffSyncApi-*_** `HttpApiUrl` output to exercise real CORS + Dynamo:
# VITE_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://xxxx.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com

# Optional: match CloudFront or localhost for share links
# VITE_PUBLIC_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173

# When `VITE_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL` is **unset**, the dev server falls back to the git seed
# `data/catalog/episodes.json` (see `src/catalog/catalogApi.ts`).
